Description: Keep peer acknowledgements off the librados callback executor.
 FSPolicy.remove_dir waits for a RADOS completion while holding its policy
 lock. A peer acknowledgement that blocks on that lock can prevent librados
 from delivering the completion. Queue the acknowledgement on the existing
 policy finisher, like the other policy callbacks.
Forwarded: not-yet
--- a/share/ceph/mgr/mirroring/fs/snapshot_mirror.py
+++ b/share/ceph/mgr/mirroring/fs/snapshot_mirror.py
@@ -168,4 +168,8 @@
     def handle_peer_ack(self, dir_path, r):
+        # Do not block the librados callback executor on the policy lock.
+        self.finisher.queue(self._handle_peer_ack, [dir_path, r])
+
